From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kth5 <alex.bldck@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 09:33:59 +1100
Subject: build: add the MC XCOFF base classes to the bundled LLVM PPC target

PPCXCOFFObjectWriter.cpp and PPCMCAsmInfo.cpp subclass
MCXCOFFObjectTargetWriter and MCAsmInfoXCOFF, but the sources defining
those base classes are not built, so libvk_swiftshader.so fails to link
on ppc64le.

Origin: Arch POWER chromium package, swiftshader-ppc-xcoff-baseclasses.patch.

diff --git a/third_party/llvm-10.0/BUILD.gn b/third_party/llvm-10.0/BUILD.gn
index f99abba3778a6d460f390e087959591d9505600c..1ba08dbb2c11fe1a9c5a824ac417d88609c4ac78 100644
--- a/third_party/llvm-10.0/BUILD.gn
+++ b/third_party/llvm-10.0/BUILD.gn
@@ -1214,6 +1214,8 @@ swiftshader_llvm_source_set("swiftshader_llvm_mips") {
 
 swiftshader_llvm_source_set("swiftshader_llvm_ppc") {
   sources = [
+    "llvm/lib/MC/MCAsmInfoXCOFF.cpp",
+    "llvm/lib/MC/MCXCOFFObjectTargetWriter.cpp",
     "llvm/lib/Target/PowerPC/AsmParser/PPCAsmParser.cpp",
     "llvm/lib/Target/PowerPC/Disassembler/PPCDisassembler.cpp",
     "llvm/lib/Target/PowerPC/MCTargetDesc/PPCAsmBackend.cpp",
